## @file
#  ArmVirtMemInfoLib for the Apple M1 platform: the MMU map of the PEI phase holds RAM and the
#  firmware volume only. No peripheral window: the guest sees no devices of its own, and the
#  few MMIO ranges DXE needs (the GIC) are mapped on demand with MapMmioLib.
#
